{"id":"901cefb5db79b842","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-implication-axiom.md","title":"蕴涵公理","display":"df-implication-axiom — 蕴涵公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-implication-axiom","aliases":["91-df-implication-axiom","91-df-conditional-axiom"],"display":"df-implication-axiom — 蕴涵公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-implication-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-implication-axiom</span><span>91-df-conditional-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implication-axiom — 蕴涵公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-implication-axiom-—-蕴涵公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}$\">df-implication-axiom — 蕴涵公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的基础语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implication\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implication\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}\\)</span> : 蕴涵公理（implication axiom）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\to \\psi\\)</span> : 蕴涵公式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>蕴涵公理的含义：\n蕴涵公理规定：蕴涵句子是真的，当且仅当前件真蕴含后件真。这是组合真理公理的一部分。</p>\n<p>蕴涵公理与组合公理的关系：\n蕴涵公理可由其他组合公理推导：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi \\equiv \\neg \\varphi \\lor \\psi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi \\to \\psi \\equiv \\neg \\varphi \\lor \\psi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\lor \\psi \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\lor \\psi \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner) \\lor T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner) \\lor T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\lor T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\lor T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>蕴涵公理在真理理论中的地位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>蕴涵公理是组合公理的自然组成部分</li>\n<li>对基础语言的经典组合理论 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span>，上述推导成立</li>\n<li>KF 不能把同一式子直接扩到任意含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 句子：若材料蕴涵按\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\)</span> 展开，其强 Kleene 真理条件使用\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\\)</span>，\n而不是外部经典式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li>这一区别来自内部/外部否定，不是所谓“仅对正公式”的限制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-implication-axiom-—-蕴涵公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}$","text":"df-implication-axiom — 蕴涵公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implication\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\to \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\to \\psi \\equiv \\neg \\varphi \\lor \\psi","display":true},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\to \\psi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\lor \\psi \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner) \\lor T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\lor T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\lor T(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":2191,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-implication-axiom]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-implication-axiom]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md